              <li>Items can be returned within 7 days of delivery</li>
              <li>Products must be unused, unwashed, and in original packaging</li>
              <li>Tags and labels must be intact</li>
              <li>Custom or personalized items are not eligible for return</li>
            </ul>
            <p><strong>Exchange Policy:</strong></p>
