              <li>Exchange is subject to stock availability</li>
              <li>Only one exchange per item is allowed</li>
              <li>Customer bears the shipping cost for exchanges</li>
            </ul>
            <p><strong>Return Process:</strong></p>
            <ul>
              <li>Contact our support team to initiate a return</li>
              <li>Pack the item securely in original packaging</li>
              <li>Use the provided return shipping label</li>
              <li>Refund will be processed within 5-7 business days after receiving the item</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
